[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4145.11, "timestamp": "01:09:05", "text": "我不应该手里拿着武器，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4146.47, "timestamp": "01:09:06", "text": "伙计。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4149.349, "timestamp": "01:09:09", "text": "我的心脏在怦怦直跳。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4152.87, "timestamp": "01:09:12", "text": "那家伙突然冒出来一枚"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4156.47, "timestamp": "01:09:16", "text": "手榴弹。 他说他是个弹药装填手。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4168.309, "timestamp": "01:09:28", "text": "，我只是想找一些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4176.87, "timestamp": "01:09:36", "text": "能得到什么就得到什么，那都是好事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4185.189, "timestamp": "01:09:45", "text": "我当时确实有点害怕。 问题不在于"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4188.789, "timestamp": "01:09:48", "text": "这类游戏，虽然语音聊天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4191.11, "timestamp": "01:09:51", "text": "很好，近距离互动也很好，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4197.27, "timestamp": "01:09:57", "text": "作为入门级游戏，它对我来说有点太复杂了。 待会儿见，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4199.35, "timestamp": "01:09:59", "text": "然后去慢跑。 你好。 谢谢。"}]